MERGE (p14:Project {name: 'DTS', description: 'DTS (Copyright) is an innovative web based software which provides a robust system to move and track physical documents (DAKs) as well as electronic documents between various departments of ONGC, in real time seamlessly. DTS is a single click tracking system, which facilitate the user to view the complete traversal history for both the physical and electronic document. The system is an efficient replacement to the traditional approach of accounting of incoming and outgoing files/letters/reports in physical registers/Excel files/local applications. The system vastly enhances the productivity and work efficiency by facilitating minimum data entry, better control, time savings, performance monitoring, faster search/retrieval and customised dynamic reports.', tagline: 'DTS (Copyright) is a web based application to track physical documents and files across offices.', developed_on: '2024'});
