MERGE (p17:Project {name: 'Duplicate File Finder', description: 'The Duplicate File Finder is a dekstop application that helps in identifying and managing duplicate files in a directory. Packaged as a standalone executable, it eliminates the need for Python installation and dependencies on multiple machines. The application features a graphical user interface (GUI) , functionalities in brief: Browse Directory: Select a directory to scan for duplicates. Find Duplicates: Start the process of finding duplicate files. Delete Selected: Remove selected duplicate files. Export to CSV: Save the duplicate list as a CSV file. Export to Excel: Save the duplicate list as an Excel file. Select/Unselect All: Manage selections in the results table. The application scans various file types including .txt, .jpg, .pdf, and more. Select the file types in the checkboxes before starting the scan. NOTE: Deletions are permanent. Review selected files carefully before confirming deletion', tagline: 'The Duplicate File Finder is a dekstop application that helps in identifying and managing duplicate files in a directory. Packaged as a standalone executable, it eliminates the need for Python installation and dependencies on multiple machines.', developed_on: '2024'});
