MERGE (p18:Project {name: 'EDS Data Management System (formerly EPINET)', description: 'Laboratory Analysis Report (LAR) is a comprehensive report containing various data types from both Geological and Geological laboratories. Additionally it also has well log data and object perforation information. The various data classes included in LAR are Well Header, Well Stratigraphy, Well Log, Lithology, Objects, Core, Petrophysical Studies, Formation Water, Sedimentology, Paleontology/Palynology/Biostratigraphy, Paleo Environment, Source Rock, Oil Analysis and Gas Analysis This application is available within Data Viewer web portal.', tagline: 'It is the technical data repository of ONGC. It comprises of both data viewing (Data Viewer) and data loading (Data Loader) applications.', developed_on: '2024'});
