MERGE (p24:Project {name: 'Explore', description: 'EXPLORE (copyright© 2018) is an innovative, integrated, and unified Exploration data management platform serving the entire Exploration value chain. The EXPLORE ecosystem is driven by logically segregated entities known as modules such as ACREAGE, LOCATION, WELL (DGR & EWIP), DISCOVERIES, ACQUISITION, GEOMAP, and INSIGHTS, where information ingested in one module is seamlessly available to other relevant modules in order to have a single version of the truth.', tagline: 'EXPLORE (copyright© 2018) is an innovative, integrated, and unified Exploration data management platform serving the entire Exploration value chain.', developed_on: '2018'});
