MERGE (p25:Project {name: 'FIRE (Final Interpretation Results in EDS)', description: 'FIRE is a software application for archival of Final Interpretation Results data in vendor and version neutral format in EDS (formerly EPINET) from multiple G & G Interpretation softwares. The application supports interpretation results data from Openworks application of Halliburton and from Petrel application of SLB. The application comprises of: (a) Data Collection Modules for Landmark Application and Petrel Application (b) Data ingestion in EDS (formerly EPINET) data model (c) Data presentation layer in EDS (formerly EPINET) portal along with data download facility The information/data and outputs selected for archival are: The Interpretation Project Header information including name, area, year, interpretation team etc., CRS and projected CRS used, Fault plane and polygons, 2D and 3D horizons, Seismic volume information, Well Data, Logs, Surface picks, Associated Maps, reports and any other document. FIRE-DTM: It is used to transfer data between Openworks and Petrel easily. This application is available within Data Viewer web portal.', tagline: 'It is a software application for archival of Final Interpretation Results data in vendor and version neutral format in EDS (formerly EPINET) from multiple G & G Interpretation softwares.', developed_on: '2024'});
