MERGE (p27:Project {name: 'Geo Chemical Log', description: 'Geo Chemical log defines quantity (generative potential), quality (kerogen types), and thermal maturity (immature / mature / post-mature) of source rocks and also pay zones with migratory hydrocarbons/ accumulations. In addition to the source rock data, other data like stratigraphy, lithology, core, sidewall core and well objects are also plotted against depth in this pictorial representation of data. This application is available within Data Viewer web portal.', tagline: 'Geochemical log defines quantity (generative potential), quality (kerogen types), and thermal maturity (immature / mature / post-mature) of source rocks and also pay zones with migratory hydrocarbons/ accumulations.', developed_on: '2024'});
