MERGE (p29:Project {name: 'Geo Technical Order (GTO)', description: 'This web based application is for online data input and generation of Geo Technical Order. It provides the facility for data input, editing and to generate the Geo Technical Order (GTO) in digital format. The various data classes included in GTO are Well Header, Geological and Geophysical, Mud Parameters, Drilling and any other data. Their is provision to upload images also. It calculates the well profile from the uploaded deviation data. It can also convert input depth from TVD (True Vertical Depth) to MD (Measured Depth). This application is available within Data Viewer web portal.', tagline: 'It is an appliction to generate the Geo Technical Order (GTO) - the comprehensive drilling plan of a well.', developed_on: '2024'});
