MERGE (p30:Project {name: 'GeoMASK (Geological Map Sketching Software)', description: 'Geological Map Sketching Software enables users to digitize contours, faults and wells. User can define custom reference points (minimum 2) for getting digitized co-ordinates on field scale and data can be exported directly in formats compatible with other scientific software.', tagline: 'Geological Map Sketching Software enables users to digitize contours, faults and wells.', developed_on: '2024'});
