MERGE (p31:Project {name: 'GeoMap', description: 'GeoMap is a webapplication developed and incorporated in Explore Platform to display GeoSpatical data. The application is very fast, responsive and versatile in handling lots of diverse geopspatial data ranging from points, polygons to geotiffs. The backend makes use of Postgres DB and Geoserver Application to store and serve data. The application has been designed to new data store very fast. User can view all ONGC wells, locations, acreages and lot more other enetites. It has even been integerated with other data systems as well e.g. EDS (formerly EPINET) and IHS platforms to fetch data from those platforms and make it available for consumption. This application is available within Explore web portal.', tagline: 'GeoMap is a webapplication developed and incorporated in Explore Platform to display GeoSpatical data.', developed_on: '2024'});
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'GeoMap'}), (d:Domain {name: 'Map Application'}) MERGE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(d);
