MERGE (p32:Project {name: 'Geophysical Services DPR Portal', description: 'The Geophysical Services Web Portal aims for record keeping of the daily shots taken for determining the LKM/SKM completed during a given time period, which helps in deciding whether the SHD/SJS was satisfactorily completed or not (target vs achievement). Provides information about the seismic surveys, daily DPR information, man power and field parties. The web app uses the tech provided by the Yii2 framework, written in PHP. The backend DB is MySQL. Bootstrap and Semantic UI used for CSS. Plotly and Datatables used for charts and tables. Vanilla Javascript and jQuery usitlied for browser effects and events.', tagline: 'The Geophysical Services Web Portal aims for record keeping of the daily shots taken for determining the LKM/SKM completed during a given time period. It Provides information about the seismic surveys, daily DPR information, man power and field parties.', developed_on: '2024'});
