MERGE (p33:Project {name: 'Helpdesk - Exploration Data Services (EDS)', description: 'It is a web appliction where user of EDS raise issues related to completeness and correctness of data in the database. It is used as a platform to monitor resolution of issues raised. User can also upload text and image files to explain the issues faced by them. This application is available within Data Viewer web portal.', tagline: 'It is a web appliction where user of EDS raise issues related to completeness and correctness of data in the database. It is used as a platform to monitor resolution of issues raised.', developed_on: '2024'});
