MERGE (p37:Project {name: 'LAS Viewer', description: 'LAS viewer is an application to visualize Log data from LAS files. Users can convert location data (latitude and longitude) from one datum/spheroid to another datum/spheroid (e.g. WGS-72 to WGS-84). User can also convert location data from latitude/longitude to northing/easting (X/Y) and vice versa. Conversion for all the prominent spheroids used in ONGC are available in the application. Transformation details including tranformation method, projection parametrs etc. are available for application user\'s reference. Users can also get the distance and bearing between any two points.', tagline: 'LAS Viewer is an application to view Log ASCII Standard (LAS) files.', developed_on: '2024'});
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'LAS Viewer'}), (d:Domain {name: 'Log'}) MERGE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(d);
