MERGE (p40:Project {name: 'License Management System - SPIC', description: 'There are a number of processing software installed in SPIC and the licenses of these software were locally managed. This web portal facilitates monitoring of the license servers and their usage. It also enables users to plan their processing activities depending on availability of the software licenses.', tagline: 'This web application facilitates monitoring of locally managed licenses and their usage.', developed_on: '2024'});
