MERGE (p42:Project {name: 'Logger', description: 'It is an application for visualizing Well Log correlation and generation of Cross plots. Some of the prominent features of LoGGer software are: • Generation of Vertical / Inclined Wells correlation profiles • Auto identifications of crossovers/hydrocarbon zones • Import / Export markers and Lithofacies • Flattening of Markers • Generation of TVD logs • Generation of Cross plots such as Lithology determination, M-N plot, Custom plots such as Vp/Vs versus Impedance plots, etc.', tagline: 'LoGGer software (Copyright @ 2018) is an application for viewing logs and for correlating logs .', developed_on: '2024'});
