MERGE (p43:Project {name: 'MISDesk', description: 'MISDesk is a Management Information System (MIS) solution, which is currently operational at GEOPIC Interpretation Group. It is a web-application that enables seamless flow of monthly progress and manpower information of G&G projects of the Annual Work Programme as well as unscheduled projects, at various functional levels. This information is used for automated, one-click generation of reports in multiple formats for internal and external communication and reporting by GEOPIC.. Internal reports are generated for perusal by HoI GEOPIC’s MSG while external reportsare sent to agencies such as E&D Dte, Finance Deptt.,COIN, Chairman’s Office etc. The application has brought immense efficiency for the MIS reporting process in the following manner: It has replaced the manual process that requires a considerable amount of time and effort for the personnel involved. Automatic Generationof reports have eliminated the need of exhaustive validation of data for consistencywhich is also prone to errors/mistakes. Created a Database for MIS data instead of storing previous reports as flat files which requires maintenance overhead at numerous locations. The workflow is now fully online, which has replaced communication of information using signed hard copies accompanying the soft versions. The database of MISDesk, being populated since FY-2018-19, now acts as a vast source of information which can be leveraged for any kind of analytics and custom report generation.The application promotes ONGC’s endeavors for a paperless office,', tagline: 'Management Information Systemsolutionfor monthly reporting of progress and timesheet data of G&G projects.', developed_on: '2018'});
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (d:Domain {name: 'Project Management & Process Workflow'}) MERGE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(d);
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (l:Location {name: 'GEOPIC'}) MERGE (p)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(l);
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (l:Location {name: 'Dehradun'}) MERGE (p)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(l);
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (t:Technology {name: 'PHP(Laravel Framework)'}) MERGE (p)-[:USES_TECH]->(t);
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (t:Technology {name: 'Bootstrap Framework for CSS'}) MERGE (p)-[:USES_TECH]->(t);
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (t:Technology {name: 'jQuery with AJAX'}) MERGE (p)-[:USES_TECH]->(t);
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (t:Technology {name: 'MariaDB'}) MERGE (p)-[:USES_TECH]->(t);
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}), (t:Technology {name: 'Web based application'}) MERGE (p)-[:USES_TECH]->(t);
MATCH (dev:Developer {name: 'Vivek Gaurav Saini'}), (p:Project {name: 'MISDesk'}) MERGE (dev)-[:DEVELOPED]->(p);

