MERGE (p46:Project {name: 'Multi Point CRS Conversion Utility', description: 'Multi point CRS conversion utility provides functionality of datum and/or projection conversion for location data for multiple points at one go. Users can convert location data (latitude and longitude) from one datum/spheroid to another datum/spheroid (e.g. WGS-72 to WGS-84). User can also convert location data from latitude/longitude to northing/easting (X/Y) Conversion for all the prominent spheroids used in ONGC are available in the application. Transformation details including tranformation method, projection parametrs etc. are available for application user\'s reference. The application has the facility to add user defined custom datum and custom projection. Facility to load input data from file and to save converted data to file is also available in the application.', tagline: 'Coordinate Reference System (CRS) data transformation utility for ONGC for multiple points.', developed_on: '2024'});
