MERGE (p58:Project {name: 'Project Cost Estimation System', description: 'Project Cost Estimation (PCE) is a comprehensive project management system designed specifically for the needs of Onshore Engineering Services(OES)-, Delhi. It is a web-application that has a powerful project cost estimation tool for installation(GGS, CTF, ETP, GCH) and pipeline projects. It features an exceptional project management workflow for OES projects that include managing Equipment costs, Supply Items, Works estimate (Civil and Electrical) and Labor costs. The calculations reflected the then introduced GST along with other taxes and duties that are a part of project cost estimation process. The application also provides dashboards for visualizations of various types of costs with breakups. Ultimately, it provides for automated, one-click generation of project cost estimation report. The application has the potential to bring immense efficiency for the Cost estimation process by replacing the manual process that requires a considerable amount of time and effort for the personnel involved. Automatic Generationof reports can eliminate the need of exhaustive validation of data for consistency which is also prone to errors/mistakes.', tagline: 'Project Cost Estimation System for calculation of costs and automatic generation of cost spreadsheets for Installation and Pipeline Projects of Onshore Engineering Projects.', developed_on: '2024'});
