MERGE (p59:Project {name: 'QHSE Internal Audit System', description: 'This portal enables internal auditors of HSE, WONB to record the audit findings online with the corresponding auditee department. Records of all the internal communications, remarks at various stages with date, closing of audit process with complied or pending status will be available online to both HSE department and Auditee department. The complaints in audit findings related to estate/civil and electrical section can be lodged through QHSE web portal, which will be reflected in CECMS (The present Civil/electrical/estate Complaint Management system) and will take priority. The whole audit process will be online capturing each and every activity of both audit and auditee department with time stamp and remarks. Salient features of QHSE Internal Audit web portal: 1. Authentication by ONGC domain login/password. 2. Authorized personnel from HSE Department can Schedule Annual audit and non-audit activity program on calendar. 3. Automatic email to the MR/DMR and Sectional head of auditee department mentioning the date of audit . 4. Scheduled activities can be seen at a glance in the dashboard to the authorized HSE team. 5. Detailed activity report at a Single prompt click from calendar. 6. Provision of monitoring department wise Internal Audit reports, the complaints raised by Auditee department during Audit process, their complaint status. 7. Integration with the existing complaint Management system CECMS(a complaint management web portal developed by Software Group, RCC, Vadodara catering towards the complaints related to Estate/ civil/ Electrical section of WON Basin). 8. The complaints related to civil, electrical and estate in audit finding, can be lodged in QHSE web portal, which will be reflected in CECMS and will take high priority to resolve. 9. The communication process like recording audit findings, action taken by MR/DMR, status of action, request forward, decline/reject, accept and close done online. 10. Automatic email intimation regarding closure of audit by I/C HSE and auto-generated report in pdf format will be sent to MR/DMR and section head of Auditee Department.', tagline: 'This portal will enable internal auditors of HSE, WONB to record the audit findings online with the corresponding auditee department.', developed_on: '2024'});
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'QHSE Internal Audit System'}), (d:Domain {name: 'Project Management & Process Workflow'}) MERGE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(d);
