MERGE (p70:Project {name: 'Seismic EBCDIC Header Generation Utility', description: 'EBCDIC header generation tool is an utility to generate the text header for both 2D and 3D Segy files. It has features for input of header information, prospect corners, parametrs related with seismic data acquisition and processing activities alongwith processed output parameters. One could also add processing steps through the utility. If the data of processing grid entered, user can also view the processing grid. User can save partially entered data in a temporary file. The same file can also be uploaded for completing the data loading task. It saves the data in the standard EBCDIC format of 40 rows X 80 Columns. The final output is saved in .txt format This application can be run from any operating system .', tagline: 'EBCDIC header generation tool is an utility to generate the text header for both 2D and 3D Segy files.', developed_on: '2024'});
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'Seismic EBCDIC Header Generation Utility'}), (d:Domain {name: 'Utility'}) MERGE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(d);
