MERGE (p72:Project {name: 'Single Point CRS Conversion Utility', description: 'Single point CRS conversion utility provides functionality of datum and/or projection conversion for location data. Users can convert location data (latitude and longitude) from one datum/spheroid to another datum/spheroid (e.g. WGS-72 to WGS-84). User can also convert location data from latitude/longitude to northing/easting (X/Y) and vice versa. Conversion for all the prominent spheroids used in ONGC are available in the application. Transformation details including tranformation method, projection parametrs etc. are available for application user\'s reference. Users can also get the distance and bearing between any two points.', tagline: 'Coordinate Reference System (CRS) data transformation utility for ONGC including distance bearing calculation.', developed_on: '2024'});
