MERGE (p79:Project {name: 'Under Development - GUI for LFPS', description: 'The desktop based GUI application will facilitate the users to predict the presence of hydrocarbon using the LFPS data coming from geophones in MSEED format. Currently, users are running different python scripts to accomplish the task. The current status of work in the app development is as follows: 1. Deconvolution completed. 2. Denoising of the signals completed. 3. Virtual stations generation completed. 4. Beta values have been calculated. 5. SVD to be done.', tagline: 'The desktop based GUI application will facilitate the users to predict the presence of hydrocarbon using the LFPS data coming from geophones in MSEED format.', developed_on: '2024'});
