MERGE (p81:Project {name: 'Under Development - Logistics Contract Management', description: 'Software development project to enhance the Logistics Department\'s efficiency by providing a comprehensive solution for managing more than 100 logistics contracts from proposal, extension to expiry. This includes monitoring proposals, tendering processes, ensuring timely contract award, contract monitoring, timely preparation and tracking of Service entry sheets (SES), invoices and payments, and managing data for over 150 vehicles, including heavy vehicles (cranes, trailers, trucks etc) and light vehicles (buses, jeeps, ambulances etc.). The software will offer detailed driver records, log vehicle usage for invoice verification, and generate custom reports and analytics for finance and administrative reporting. Intuitive dashboards and notifications emails will enable proactive monitoring of contract execution status and future planning, ensuring operational excellence and strategic insights.', tagline: 'It is an appliction enhance the Logistics department\'s efficiency by providing a comprehensive solution for managing more than 100 logistics contracts from proposal, extension to expiry.', developed_on: '2024'});
