MERGE (p85:Project {name: 'VASUDA (Visualization and Administration of seismic SUrveys and Data Acquisition)', description: 'It is an online portal for GPS & Basin to view and monitor Seismic survey coverage of different Seismic Investigations running under GPS-Vadodara on day-to-day basis. Salient features of the web portal are 1. Authentication by ONGC domain login/password. 2. Seamless Monitoring of ongoing seismic data acquisition in near to real-time. 3. Visualization of acquisition boundary area with shot and receiver location on High Resolution GIS map. 4. Different coloured shots represent shot status i.e. accepted, rejected, failed, skipped or pending. 5. DPR data from SAP pulled through API can be seen in charts, month wise report, day wise report etc. 6. Provides a BI and analytics platform for the management, to take faster and better decision.', tagline: 'VASUDA is an online portal for GPS & Basin to view and monitor Seismic survey coverage of different Seismic Investigations running under GPS-Vadodara on day-to-day basis.', developed_on: '2024'});
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'VASUDA (Visualization and Administration of seismic SUrveys and Data Acquisition)'}), (d:Domain {name: 'Seismic'}) MERGE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(d);
