MERGE (p88:Project {name: 'Yatrika - Digitization of Vehicle Logbook and Passenger Transport Management System', description: 'The objective of the project is to record travel logs of company\'s vehicle in digital form and provide a vehicle management system for logistic control room. It comprises of a mobile app (android / ios) and a website. Mobile app: It is used by employee for maintaining travel e-logbook. Company\'s vehicle are allocated to senior management employees for operational requirement .Each employee maintains the logbook for the vehicle allotted to them. Logbook contains information like everyday\' first reporting of vehicle with details like(date, time, place and meter reading), subsequent journeys details and day\'s closing details of vehicle. Along with elogbook, using app an employee can also request for vehicle share to another employee who is having a vehicle allotment for one/more journey. Web app: It is used by logistic control room for management of passenger vehicle. It has all the features of mobile app as well. Using website vehicle control room supervisor can carry out allotment, de-allotment of vehicle on permanent and temporary basis. Other features like replacement of vehicle, driver, management vehicle related contract can also be done through portal.', tagline: 'The application is for digitization of vehicle logbook and creation of a passenger transport management system.', developed_on: '2024'});
MATCH (p:Project {name: 'Yatrika - Digitization of Vehicle Logbook and Passenger Transport Management System'}), (d:Domain {name: 'Logistic'}) MERGE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(d);
